The circle has center $ (11, 10) $, radius 1.

So possible points:

1. $ (11 + 1, 10) = (12, 10) $
2. $ (11 - 1, 10) = (10, 10) $
3. $ (11, 10 + 1) = (11, 11) $
4. $ (11, 10 - 1) = (11, 9) $

Compute $ xy $ for each:

